{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25995","headline":"秋思 · 鲍溶","name":"秋思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚客秋更悲，皇皇无声地。\n时无无事人，我命与身异。\n良时如飞鸟，回掌成故事。\n蹉跎秋定还，凝冽坚冰至。\n人生不期老，华发谁能避。\n感此惜壮年，壮年少爲贵。\n我生虽努力，荣途难自致。\n徒爲击角歌，且慙雕劒字。\n吾师罕言命，感激潜伤思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25995.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25995","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}